The WT lysozyme protein sequences from human, dog and giant panda were aligned. Conserved regions included FERCELARTLK and DYGIFQINSRYWCNDGKTP. Amino acid differences were also observed; for example, immediately after the conserved GTP motif, human lysozyme contained glycine (G), whereas dog and giant panda lysozymes contained arginine (R). No gaps were present in the alignment.
